message: "If you use or cite this book, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Security Mastery: From ML Fundamentals to Production Detection Systems"
abstract: >-
  A 90-day, implementation-first learning path for security professionals
  entering AI security. Covers ML and deep learning foundations built from
  NumPy, LLM architecture and internals, the AI attack surface (prompt
  injection, jailbreaks, data poisoning, model extraction, adversarial ML),
  and detection engineering through production deployment. 18 chapters,
  267 sections, MIT licensed.
